---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import ContactCTA from "../components/ContactCTA.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Michael Miller" description="About Michael Miller">
  <div class="stack gap-20">
    <main class="wrapper about">
      <Hero
        title="About"
        tagline="Thanks for stopping by. Read below to learn more about myself and my background."
      >
        <img
          width="1553"
          height="873"
          src="/assets/profilephoto_two.jpg"
          alt="Michael volunteering at a local event in his community."
        />
      </Hero>

      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>
            I'm a full-stack software developer at Pingram, a developer
            messaging platform for email, SMS, and inbound communication. Day
            to day that means the React dashboard, AWS Lambda APIs, generated
            SDKs, CLI, docs, and the pipelines that ship them.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before Pingram I built web and mobile products at Get Coding, after
            completing their full-stack program. That career started in
            construction and project management — planning, sequencing work, and
            getting teams across the finish line — which still shows up in how I
            break down software work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>Pingram (formerly NotificationAPI)</p>
          <p>Full Stack Software Developer</p>
          <p>2024 – present</p>
          <p>
            Product engineering across the dashboard, serverless backend, SDKs,
            CLI, GitHub Actions integrations, and documentation. Most of the
            work is TypeScript on AWS: Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, SES, and
            the surrounding observability and CI.
          </p>
          <p>Get Coding Training Inc.</p>
          <p>Full Stack and Mobile Application Developer</p>
          <p>2023 – 2024</p>
          <p>
            Built and maintained the student/coach tracking product across web
            and React Native, including student-facing mobile features and a
            recruitment dashboard for partner companies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>Get Coding Training Inc.</p>
          <a
            href="https://getcoding.ca"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Coding</a
          >
          <p>Full Stack Development</p>
          <p>Jan 2022 – March 2023</p>
          <p>
            After a few years wanting to move into tech, I joined Get Coding and
            trained weekly with working software developers in React, Node.js,
            PostgreSQL, and AWS.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Skills</h2>
        <div class="content">
          <p>
            TypeScript and React for product UI; Node.js and AWS Lambda for
            APIs; DynamoDB, SES, SNS, and SQS for data and delivery; CDK and
            Serverless Framework for infrastructure. I also spend a lot of time
            on developer-facing work: OpenAPI-generated SDKs, CLI packaging,
            docs in Astro, and CI with GitHub Actions. Earlier work includes
            React Native, PostgreSQL, and GraphQL/AppSync.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <ContactCTA />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  img {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--gray-200);
  }

  .section-title {
    grid-column-start: 1;
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--gray-0);
  }

  .content {
    grid-column: 2 / 4;
  }

  .content :global(a) {
    text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
  }

  .content :global(a:hover),
  .content :global(a:focus) {
    text-decoration-color: currentColor;
  }

  @media (min-width: 50em) {
    .about {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
    }

    .about > :global(:first-child) {
      grid-column-start: 2;
    }

    section {
      display: contents;
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
